  "title": "Two-Ingredient Dough Pigs in a Blanket",
  "description": "Use homemade 2-ingredient dough to make these quick pigs in a blanket for your next party.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-06-06T10:01:05-04:00",
